<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '24px 64px 0' }}>
    {/* A 区 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 96, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'flex-start' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1423' }}>
            第一阶：以终为始，<span style={{ color: '#FA4F24' }}>描绘愿景</span>（步骤 1–5）
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#8A8F99', marginTop: 8 }}>
            这一阶不碰任何系统，产出的是方向——方向错了，后面九步做得越认真偏得越远
        </Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#E8E8E8' }} />

    {/* B 区 */}
    <Box style={{ paddingTop: 16, paddingBottom: 12, height: 479, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>

        {/* 五步横条 */}
        <Box style={{ height: 190, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 8 }}>
            {[
                { n: '01', t: '理解企业战略诉求', d: '业务高层访谈，拿到战略与期望', o: '访谈纪要 + 战略解码', c: '#FA4F24' },
                { n: '02', t: '5「看」', d: '战略 / 客户 / 行业 / 自己 / 技术', o: '五看扫描 + 机会清单', c: '#FA4F24' },
                { n: '03', t: '成熟度评估', d: '关键业务用户访谈 + 评估模型', o: '访谈纪要 + 打分表', c: '#FA4F24' },
                { n: '04', t: '现状和差距分析', d: '对标业界，找业务与 IT 的差', o: '差距清单', c: '#FA4F24' },
                { n: '05', t: '描绘数字化愿景', d: '不拘泥于现状，有前瞻性', o: '愿景蓝图', c: '#FA4F24', main: true },
            ].map((x) => (
                <Box key={x.n} style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F7F8', borderRadius: 4, padding: '0 13px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 7, marginTop: 12 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: x.c }}>{x.n}</Text>
                        {x.main && (
                            <Box style={{ height: 16, background: x.c, borderRadius: 2, padding: '0 6px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                                <Text style={{ fontSize: 10, color: '#FFFFFF' }}>主线</Text>
                            </Box>
                        )}
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1423', marginTop: 10, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>{x.t}</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#3A4050', lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 9, flex: 1 }}>{x.d}</Text>
                    <Box style={{ height: 38, background: x.c, borderRadius: 3, marginBottom: 10, padding: '0 9px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 10.5, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.92)', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>{x.o}</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
            ))}
        </Box>

        {/* 中：华为愿景本体 */}
        <Box style={{ height: 168, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#0F1423', borderRadius: 4, padding: '15px 20px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FBA15C' }}>华为自己的愿景是怎么写的（原书 3.1.3）</Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10, marginTop: 12 }}>
                    {[
                        { t: '面向 5 类用户实现 ROADS 体验', d: '不是给内部人做系统，是给五类不同用户各自「好用的」体验' },
                        { t: '大平台支撑精兵作战', d: '平台能力统一建，作战单元小而精——这是三个平台存在的理由' },
                    ].map((x) => (
                        <Box key={x.t} style={{ flex: 1, background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.07)', borderLeft: '3px solid #FA4F24', borderRadius: 2, padding: '0 14px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>{x.t}</Text>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.78)', lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 7 }}>{x.d}</Text>
                        </Box>
                    ))}
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 392, background: '#FFF3EE', borderRadius: 4, borderLeft: '4px solid #FA4F24', padding: '15px 18px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C43A17' }}>这一阶最常见的三个坑</Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6, marginTop: 10 }}>
                    {[
                        '愿景写成口号（「数字化赋能高质量发展」），没有一句能被验证',
                        '只访谈高管不访谈一线，高管说想做什么，一线说实际卡在哪',
                        '把现状当起点——华为要求「不拘泥于现状」，这是愿景与规划的分水岭',
                    ].map((x, i) => (
                        <Box key={x} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', gap: 7, flex: 1 }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#FA4F24', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>{'0' + (i + 1)}</Text>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 11.5, color: '#3A4050', lineHeight: 1.35, flex: 1 }}>{x}</Text>
                        </Box>
                    ))}
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        {/* 底部铁律 */}
        <Box style={{ height: 42, background: '#0F1423', borderRadius: 3, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 20px', gap: 16 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FBA15C' }}>第一阶铁律</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15.5, color: '#FFFFFF', flex: 1 }}>先有愿景，后有架构；<tspan style={{ color: '#FA4F24' }}>跳到架构设计去，前五步就是走过场</tspan></Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    {/* C 区 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 14, height: 14, background: '#FA4F24' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A8F99' }}>硕磐机密 · 华为数字化转型之道</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A8F99' }}>15 / 35</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>